5.4 Orientation Questions


1. What if one of our members is not available during the presentation?
Unfortunately, up to 10 points can be removed from the team. However the team will still be allowed to present without the member. 
2. What if we didn’t finish our report by the stated deadline?
Again, you may receive point deductions but you would still be scheduled to present your topics to the panel of judges. It is solely up to the discretion of the judges to determine if you can present your finished slides. 








